# Per-user app-drawer state (the user's pinned apps), not repo config. The
# installer's copy lives in ~/.config/quickshell/appdrawer/ and is never
# overwritten once it exists; this is here so running the drawer from a repo
# checkout can't leak one person's favourites into a commit.
quickshell/appdrawer/favourites.json